  "description": "Lunae Lebouton couldn’t be more thrilled to say “yes.” With her happiness secured, she truly has it all, but the best day of her life quickly becomes the worst. Ripped from her blissful life, she wakes up orphaned and married to the same man she saw that night–Duke William Vuittolang. Determined to reveal the truth and get back to the arms of her love, she soon discovers she’s surrounded by enemies and worse—someone is not who they claim to be. Who is to blame, and who can be trusted?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
